Meta.documentation:Boolean
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:A truth value: true or false.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:Booleans are value resources, written Boolean:true and Boolean:false. Logic
Meta.documentation:lives in child resources (and, or, not, if); comparisons in Number and String
Meta.documentation:(equal, less, greater) produce Booleans.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:octetstream interface — in_octetstream_default_$all parses bytes as true/false
Meta.documentation:text; out_octetstream_default offers the value in that form. Used by http:,
Meta.documentation:file: and Dawn.cast when loading content.
Meta.documentation:@port in_octetstream_default_$all — bytes parsed as true/false text
Meta.documentation:@port out_octetstream_default — the value as true/false bytes
Meta.documentation:@example
Meta.documentation:Boolean:true>>Boolean.not:>>Console:
